  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">JAM Env statistics</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">JAM milj&#xf6;statistik</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Projektet syftar till att etablera en milj&#xf6;statistikfunktion inom den jamaikanska statistikmyndigheten. Milj&#xf6;statistik skall samlas in, bearbetas och presenteras kontinuerligt bl a som underlag f&#xf6;r beslutsfattande i milj&#xf6;relaterade fr&#xe5;gor. Svensk part SCB.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Project aims at providing expertise for establishing the produc- tion of environmental statistics at the Statistical Institute of Jam. in order to facilitate confident and professional decisionmaking . A system for producing data regularly will be devised and organised. Swedish partner is Statistics Sweden (SCB).</narrative>
  </description>
